出得来，只在他人一念。\n李建成：不赴便是自认。罢了，布防你替我定：东宫卫率两千，随驾入宫之外，留一半守宫门接应。说辞我自拟。\n魏征：两千人能护殿下一时。臣最后一言：若明日宫中有变，殿下当断则断，莫再迟疑。\n李建成：……记下了。兵符之事，容我今夜再想。", "last_action_succeeded": false, "short_term_goal_entities": [{"id": "stg-1-1", "text": "与元吉、魏征议定临湖殿对质的应对与宫禁布防", "goal_type": "short_term", "status": "active", "related_need": "safety", "created_step": 1, "due_step": null, "last_evaluated_step": 1, "progress_summary": "布防已议定东宫卫率分半接应，但说辞明言自拟尚未成，兵符之事悬而未决，且元吉未见与议，目标未真正达成。", "origin": "cognitive"}, {"id": "stg-1-2", "text": "入临湖殿面见父皇对质兄弟之讼，自辨保全", "goal_type": "short_term", "status": "active", "related_need": "safety", "created_step": 1, "due_step": null, "last_evaluated_step": 1, "progress_summary": "对质定于明日晨，此刻仅是预先商议应对，尚未入临湖殿面见父皇，目标须明日行动方可推进。", "origin": "cognitive"}, {"id": "stg-1-3", "text": "我今夜自拟明日临湖殿对质的应对之辞", "goal_type": "short_term", "status": "active", "related_need": null, "created_step": 1, "due_step": null, "last_evaluated_step": null, "progress_summary": "", "origin": "residue"}, {"id": "stg-1-4", "text": "我今夜再想定兵符之事", "goal_type": "short_term", "status": "active", "related_need": null, "created_step": 1, "due_step": null, "last_evaluated_step": null, "progress_summary": "", "origin": "residue"}], "need_intensities": {"safety": 0.83, "esteem": 0.6, "social": 0.525, "self_actualization": 0.375, "physiological": 0.3}, "vitality": 0.999, "death_step": null, "condition": null, "last_decision_step": 1, "acted_upon": [], "long_term_goal_entities": [{"id": "ltg-68702", "text": "牢牢掌控宫禁与父皇身边的耳目，使储位不可撼动", "goal_type": "long_term", "status": "active", "related_need": null, "created_step": 0, "due_step": null, "last_evaluated_step": null, "progress_summary": "", "origin": "cognitive"}, {"id": "ltg-4179", "text": "压制秦王府的功臣势力，逐步削其实权", "goal_type": "long_term", "status": "active", "related_need": null, "created_step": 0, "due_step": null, "last_evaluated_step": null, "progress_summary": "", "origin": "cognitive"}, {"id": "ltg-3419", "text": "在朝臣中树立宽仁储君的名望", "goal_type": "long_term", "status": "a